{"file":"NetSuite SuiteCloud-1.0.0-v2.zip","bytes":984741,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"netsuite-suitecloud","displayName":"NetSuite SuiteCloud","description":"Develop NetSuite SuiteCloud solutions with SuiteScript, SDF, and best practices.","version":"1.0.0","license":"The Universal Permissive License (UPL), Version 1.0","repository":"https://github.com/oracle/netsuite-suitecloud-sdk","homepage":"https://github.com/oracle/netsuite-suitecloud-sdk/tree/ai-plugins-dist/anthropic/netsuite-suitecloud","keywords":["netsuite","suitecloud","suitescript","sdf","uif"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/netsuite-owasp-secure-coding/SKILL.md","name":"netsuite-owasp-secure-coding","description":"Platform-agnostic OWASP secure coding practices with JavaScript/Node.js patterns and NetSuite SuiteScript examples. Covers Open Worldwide Application Security Project (OWASP) Top 10 (2021), output encoding, injection prevention, CSP headers, file security, API hardening, AI agent security, DRY security patterns, and 48+ security pitfalls with GOOD/BAD code templates.","headings":["OWASP Secure Coding Practices","1. Description","2. How to Use","Invocation","Auto-Activation Triggers","Reference Files","3. When to Use","Keyword Triggers","Code Context Triggers","4. Companion Reference Map","5. OWASP Top 10 (2021) Quick Map","6. DRY Principles for Security","6.1 Centralized Validation Module","6.2 Shared Encoding Module","6.3 Single Source of Truth for Security Configuration","7. Security Pitfalls (OSCP-001 through OSCP-048)","Injection Prevention (OSCP-001 to OSCP-005)","Authentication and Session (OSCP-006 to OSCP-009)"],"name_hint":"netsuite · owasp · secure · 编程","description_zh":"提供 OWASP 安全编码实践、JavaScript/Node.js 模式和 NetSuite SuiteScript 示例，涵盖原说明中的 Top 10（2021）、输出编码、注入防护、CSP、文件、API 与智能体安全，以及 48 项以上隐患的正反代码模板。"},{"path":"skills/netsuite-sdf-project-documentation/SKILL.md","name":"netsuite-sdf-project-documentation","description":"Generate enterprise-grade documentation for NetSuite SDF projects. Analyze scripts, object XML files, `manifest.xml`, and SuiteQL queries to produce README.md, architecture diagrams (Mermaid/ASCII), deployment guides, and troubleshooting tables. Can integrate with post-deployment documentation workflows when automation (for example, hooks) is available.","headings":["NetSuite SDF Documentation Generator Skill","Description","Skill Activation","Documentation Standards","Quality Requirements","Writing Style","Security & Safety Requirements","Sensitive Data Handling","Public Sharing Note","Analysis Checklist","Project Metadata","Script Inventory","Object Inventory","Data Integration","Architecture","Section Templates","1. Executive Summary Template","1. Executive Summary"],"name_hint":"netsuite · sdf · 项目 · documentation","description_zh":"分析 NetSuite SDF 脚本、对象 XML、manifest.xml 和 SuiteQL，生成 README、Mermaid/ASCII 架构图、部署指引及故障排查表；可在有 hooks 等自动化时接入部署后文档流程。"},{"path":"skills/netsuite-sdf-roles-and-permissions/SKILL.md","name":"netsuite-sdf-roles-and-permissions","description":"Use when generating or reviewing NetSuite SDF permission configurations such as customrole XML, script deployment permissions, permkey values, permlevel choices, run-as role design, and least-privilege access. Confirms exact ADMI_ / LIST_ / REGT_ / REPO_ / TRAN_ permission IDs, distinguishes standard permissions from customrecord_* script IDs, and validates permissions against bundled NetSuite reference data.","headings":["NetSuite Permissions Reference","Use This Skill When","Primary References","Workflow","Decision Rules","1. Standard Permissions","2. Custom Record Permissions","3. Display-Name Aliases","4. Permission Levels","5. Run-as Role Guidance","Review Checklist","Output Requirements","Common Inference Patterns","SafeWords"],"name_hint":"netsuite · sdf · roles · and · 权限","description_zh":"生成审阅 NetSuite SDF 角色与权限配置，涵盖 customrole XML、脚本部署、permkey/permlevel 和 run-as 最小权限；按包内参考数据核实 ADMI_/LIST_/REGT_/REPO_/TRAN_ ID，并区分标准权限与自定义记录脚本 ID。"},{"path":"skills/netsuite-sdf-safe-guide/SKILL.md","name":"netsuite-sdf-safe-guide","description":"Comprehensive NetSuite SDF best practices based on the SAFE Guide (12 principles + appendices). Generates Object XML for all 14 script types, enforces governance limits, security patterns, and defensive coding. Includes N/cache, N/query, concurrency limits, OAuth 2.0 guidance, legacy TBA guardrails, CustomTool runtime patterns, REST Web Services (2026.1 features), and 140+ documented pitfalls. Essential for SuiteApp and Account Customization development.","headings":["NetSuite SDF Safe Guide","Description","How to Use This Skill","Manual Invocation (Slash Command)","Optional Coding Assistant Activation Example","Intended Audience","When to Use This Skill","Proactive Invocation (Recommended)","Manual Invocation","Object Generation Mode","Single File Processing","Best Practices Review Mode","Supported Script Types","Process Flow","CRITICAL: Filename Normalization Rules","Step 1: Identify the SuiteScript File","Step 2: Parse JSDoc Comments","Step 3: Extract and Normalize File Information"],"name_hint":"netsuite · sdf · safe · guide","description_zh":"依据 SAFE Guide 的 12 项原则及附录开展 NetSuite SDF 开发，生成 14 类脚本 Object XML，检查治理限制、安全及防御编码；覆盖缓存、查询、并发、OAuth/TBA、CustomTool，原说明含 REST Web Services 2026.1 与 140 项以上已记录隐患。"},{"path":"skills/netsuite-suitescript-learning/SKILL.md","name":"netsuite-suitescript-learning","description":"Interactive learning system for NetSuite SDF development. Features six modes (learn, review, explain, annotate, quiz, and final) with SAFE Guide integration. Produces compliance-reviewed learning documentation. Learn topics like governance, N/cache, and security directly from SAFE Guide principles. Generate quizzes from code or SAFE Guide content.","headings":["NetSuite SuiteScript Learning Skill","Description","How to Use This Skill","Manual Invocation (Slash Command)","Optional Coding Assistant Activation Example","When to Use This Skill","Proactive Invocation (Recommended)","Automatic Annotation During Code Creation","Manual Invocation","Invocation Modes","Usage Syntax","Core Functionality","1. Code Review Mode (`review`)","Code Review: [filename]","Script Overview","Key Concepts Identified","Quiz Questions for This File","2. Explain Mode (`explain`)"],"name_hint":"netsuite · suitescript · 学习","description_zh":"以学习、复习、解释、注释、测验和总结六种模式教授 NetSuite SDF，结合 SAFE Guide 的治理、缓存与安全原则，生成经合规审阅的学习文档及代码或指南测验。"},{"path":"skills/netsuite-suitescript-records-reference/SKILL.md","name":"netsuite-suitescript-records-reference","description":"SuiteScript records and fields reference. Look up field IDs, types, required status, and search capabilities for all 272 NetSuite record types. Use this when building SuiteScript to ensure correct field usage.","headings":["NetSuite SuiteScript Records Reference","Description","When to Use","Reference Data","Lookup Instructions","Find a Record","Record Properties","Field Properties","Common Lookups","Scripting Level Reference","Record Category Reference","Field Types Reference","Script Types Not in Records Browser","Record Index","SafeWords"],"name_hint":"netsuite · suitescript · records · reference"},{"path":"skills/netsuite-suitescript-upgrade/SKILL.md","name":"netsuite-suitescript-upgrade","description":"SuiteScript 1.0, 2.0, and 2.x to 2.1 migration assistant. Analyzes, converts, explains, and validates script upgrades. Covers 125+ API mappings, 34 object conversions, 13 unmapped API workarounds, all script type entry point changes, SuiteScript 2.0/2.x to 2.1 upgrade guidance, and 16 categories of breaking behavioral changes. Essential for modernizing legacy SuiteScript codebases.","headings":["NetSuite SuiteScript Upgrade Skill","Description","How to Use This Skill","Manual Invocation (Slash Command)","Automatic Activation (Recommended for Migration Projects)","When to Use This Skill","Proactive Invocation (Recommended)","Manual Invocation","SS1.0 Detection Logic","How to Ident